<LegalLayout title="Accessibility statement" eyebrow="Legal / 06" currentPage="/accessibility" intro="Our commitment to make Crest Automotive Care’s website usable by as many people as possible, across devices and input methods.">
  <h2>1. Our commitment</h2>
  <p>Crest Automotive Care aims to provide an accessible, understandable and usable website for customers, residents and visitors. We use semantic HTML, visible focus states, responsive layouts, readable contrast, descriptive labels and reduced-motion support as part of that effort.</p>
  <p>This statement does not claim that the site conforms to a particular WCAG level unless an independent review has confirmed it. Our implementation direction is informed by the <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">W3C Web Content Accessibility Guidelines 2.2</a>, which groups accessibility under perceivable, operable, understandable and robust principles.</p>

  <h2>2. Features in this website</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Keyboard-reachable navigation, buttons, form fields and calculator controls.</li>
    <li>Visible focus styling for interactive elements.</li>
    <li>Labels and titles for forms, embedded maps and navigation landmarks.</li>
    <li>Responsive layouts for desktop, tablet and mobile screens.</li>
    <li>A reduced-motion preference that limits non-essential transitions and scroll animation.</li>
    <li>Text alternatives for the generated automotive images when the production photography is replaced.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Known limitations</h2>
  <p>The Google Maps embed and any future third-party social, analytics or booking services may not provide the same accessibility experience as Crest’s own page. Generated or supplied photography may also require final alternative text review. The legal pages, pricing matrix and calculator should be re-tested after any major content or vendor change.</p>

  <h2>4. Feedback and assistance</h2>
  <p>If you encounter a barrier, please contact <strong>[insert accessibility email]</strong> or call <a href="tel:+919871610952">+91 98716 10952</a>. Tell us the page, device, browser, assistive technology if relevant, and what you were trying to do. We will use the report to investigate and improve the experience.</p>
  <p>If you need help booking a treatment, you can also contact the Crest team directly or request an alternative method of communication.</p>

  <h2>5. Review</h2>
  <p>Accessibility owner: <strong>[insert responsible person or team]</strong>. Last reviewed: <strong>22 August 2026</strong>. Next planned review: <strong>[insert review date]</strong>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
